        "collapsible_tab_UFJziw": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features & experience",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>The FeelVictoria Mouth Stroker is designed to be used with Kiiroo PowerBlow and Keon for a more interactive experience. It is described as being molded after Victoria’s mouth and lips and is intended to create a realistic oral-style experience.</p><p>PowerBlow is an interactive suction device that fits on the end of compatible Feel Strokers and other strokers that use the same screw mechanism. The setup includes Bluetooth, Manual, and Automatic modes, along with customizable blowjob patterns.</p><p>It can connect using FeelMe AI for interactive content and supports quick onboarding through the FeelConnect app. It is also listed as compatible with FeelSensation, FeelVictoria Mouth, FeelKayley, and FeelTanya Stroker.</p>{{ block.settings.page.content }}",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
