          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product information",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<h3>Features</h3><ul><li>Designed for use with<br/>PowerBlow</li><li>Designed for use with<br/>Keon</li><li>Bluetooth mode</li><li>Manual mode</li><li>Automatic mode</li><li>Customizable blowjob<br/>patterns</li><li>Connects using FeelMe<br/>AI</li><li>Quick onboarding with<br/>the FeelConnect app</li><li>Compatible with<br/>FeelSensation</li><li>Compatible with<br/>FeelVictoria Mouth</li><li>Compatible with<br/>FeelKayley</li><li>Compatible with<br/>FeelTanya Stroker</li></ul><h3>FeelVictoria Mouth Stroker</h3><ul><li>Stroker material:<br/>ABS, PC</li><li>Case material: TPE</li><li>Weight: 542 g</li><li>Height: 235 mm /<br/>23.5 cm</li><li>Width: Bottom cap<br/>60 mm, top cap 75 mm</li><li>Length: Bottom cap<br/>55 mm, top cap 70 mm</li></ul><h3>Kiiroo PowerBlow</h3><ul><li>Material: ABS, PU<br/>foam, silicone ring</li><li>Weight: 198 g</li><li>Height: 72 mm / 7.2<br/>cm</li><li>Top diameter: 78 mm<br/>/ 7.8 cm</li><li>Bottom diameter: 60<br/>mm / 6 cm</li></ul><p><strong>Box includes</strong></p><ul><li>1 x FeelVictoria<br/>Mouth Stroker by Kiiroo</li><li>1 x Kiiroo<br/>PowerBlow</li><li>1 x silicone ring</li><li>1 glass for stroke</li><li>1 x replacement<br/>absorbent foam ring</li><li>1 x USB-C charging<br/>cable</li><li>1 quick start guide</li><li>1 voucher booklet</li></ul><p> </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_CDVNV9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why you'll love it",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>You’ll love it if you want a setup built around suction-based interactive stimulation with app connectivity and multiple control modes. The combination of the FeelVictoria Mouth Stroker and PowerBlow is designed to offer a more customizable and immersive experience.</p><p>Its Bluetooth support, Manual and Automatic modes, compatibility with interactive content, and support for the FeelConnect app make it a more connected option than a standard stroker.</p>",
